# Optional. Add your Google Maps JavaScript API key to render the native Google
# Maps widget (satellite / hybrid / roadmap) as the base map.
#
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/get-api-key
#
# Without a key the app automatically falls back to free, keyless Esri
# satellite imagery (World Imagery) so the live map still renders everywhere.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=